            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il nonno ci leggeva un racconto ogni sera. Grandfather used to read us a story every evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on raccontare, ‘to tell’."
            }
          ]
